{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Dominion \u2013 Souls Like, a new generation game from ZERO5GAMES Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/4.gif?t=1745245613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Ancient times there was piece and quiet in Artsworth Kingdom but the evil ruled supreme. The usurper, Ernest VIII, seized the throne and sold the evil forces his and the other residents\u2019 souls for the wealth and vanity. Kingdom archimages tried to put everything to its place but it was too late. He dreamed of enslaving the whole continent, his warriors were sold on certain death but the curse was able to win and his kingdom was fully maledicted and destroyed. You are assigned to return the kingdom its ancient glory, totally override the evil seized this world and fight against the seven mighty gods of human sins. Let light or darkness lead you to victory or oblivion, my death knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/Video_25.gif?t=1745245613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extraordinary new generation graphics \u2013 be ready to see the photorealism that you have never met in the games of the same genre. The picture would be literally realistic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cruel game world \u2013 the enemy is simply in rage fancying to bear you down. Unbelievable difficulty level that has never been seen in Souls games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve all this world mysteries and learn what had happened to the main character in the end and what is taking place in the world.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/1_1.gif?t=1745245613\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag